meta {
  name: 4. Get Trip POD Settings (dedicated endpoint)
  type: http
  seq: 4
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/trips/{{podSettingsTripId}}/v1/settings/epod
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{accessToken}}
}

docs {
  The pre-existing dedicated per-trip POD-settings endpoint (predates PR #932, already live on
  staging). Verified live on 2026-09-10 for this driver/trip:

  {
    "data": {
      "driverUploadEnabled": true,
      "completionRadiusEnabled": false,
      "completionRadiusMeters": null,
      "remainingDistance": 211.77
    },
    "message": "Success",
    "statusCode": 200,
    "success": true
  }

  Once PR #932 reaches staging, this same response also gains
  `completionRadiusRemainingDistanceMeters` (null here since completionRadiusEnabled is false for
  this trip's torg) — see the "Get Trip POD Settings" reference request under
  `bruno/collections/plutus-api/trips/` for what a nonzero value looks like.
}
